"[NTP]: Write wallpaper search background via temp file and rename" and
"[NTP]: Write uploaded background via temp file and rename" (crbug
574922421; no CVE listed yet): the New Tab Page wrote its custom background
images to predictable paths in the profile with base::WriteFile() and
base::CopyFile(), which follow a symlink planted there (defence in depth on
Linux, where the profile is the user's). chromium/src main commits
20d97d146792b557329553a2763a9a4f70699930 and
ff485c32da28c64d1aa0803bb38f0b93fda7a204, merged on 2026-10-31 to 157 as
27a880a12401256016bd2bf8fed0c23ee6e01d96 and
3b20653862d18207865315d38135c4ca53f5e402 (after the 157.0.8103.34 tag), and
to 156 and 158. These are the two 157 merges, in order, without their
tests. Drop it once a 157 tag has them.

